  "description": "<p>Currently search queries returning the rdf_type field gets very slow as the database grows.  </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>For example this query is relatively fast (.3 secs) on a fedora with 1 million resources.</p>\n\n<p>curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin \"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/fcr:search?fields=fedora_id,mime_type,modified&amp;max_results=10\"</p>\n\n<p>However this takes 19 seconds.<br/>\ncurl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin \"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/fcr:search?fields=fedora_id,mime_type,modified,rdf_type&amp;max_results=10\"</p>",
